        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "J. Procedures for the Fair Distribution of Field Trips—Field trips will be assigned on a fair and equitable basis for those drivers who express an interest. First assignments will be to drivers whose total workday (including field trips) does not exceed eight (8) hours and the workweek does not exceed forty (40) hours.",
